WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:09.216
Hi! Welcome to A1.2! Today we make appointments.

2
00:00:09.616 --> 00:00:14.064
At the doctor's, the hairdresser's or with friends.

3
00:00:15.767 --> 00:00:20.863
When is the appointment? You need these words:

4
00:00:21.263 --> 00:00:24.487
For days: am Montag (on Monday).

5
00:00:24.887 --> 00:00:28.423
For the time: um zehn Uhr (at ten).

6
00:00:28.823 --> 00:00:32.095
For months: im Juni (in June).

7
00:00:32.495 --> 00:00:36.535
And for a period: von neun bis zwölf (from nine to twelve).

8
00:00:38.233 --> 00:00:41.049
You call and say:

9
00:00:41.449 --> 00:00:44.217
I need an appointment.

10
00:00:44.617 --> 00:00:46.761
Then you ask:

11
00:00:47.161 --> 00:00:49.785
Is Friday possible?

12
00:00:50.185 --> 00:00:53.721
Geht es means: is that possible?

13
00:00:55.433 --> 00:00:59.881
The appointment is good? Then you say:

14
00:01:00.281 --> 00:01:03.241
Yes, that suits me.

15
00:01:03.641 --> 00:01:08.353
The appointment isn't good? Then you say:

16
00:01:08.753 --> 00:01:11.425
I'm afraid I can't then.

17
00:01:13.133 --> 00:01:17.341
Listen: Mateo calls the hairdresser's.

18
00:01:17.741 --> 00:01:21.541
Salon Haarmonie, hello!

19
00:01:21.941 --> 00:01:24.709
I need an appointment.

20
00:01:25.109 --> 00:01:28.645
Is Tuesday at ten OK?

21
00:01:29.045 --> 00:01:31.717
I'm afraid I can't then.

22
00:01:32.117 --> 00:01:35.125
And Wednesday at four?

23
00:01:35.525 --> 00:01:39.949
Yes, that suits me. Thanks!

24
00:01:41.633 --> 00:01:51.673
Now you! Call the doctor. Say: I need an appointment. Is Monday possible?

25
00:02:01.367 --> 00:02:05.503
Great! Now you can:

26
00:02:05.903 --> 00:02:10.903
You make appointments and say yes or no – very politely.

27
00:02:11.303 --> 00:02:13.423
See you soon!
